I think you want to also include the "-all" flag before your archive. I.e.

ld -shared -o fred.so fred.o stuff.o -hidden -all extras.a -none -non_hidden

You will probably also want to include at least "-lc" on the end of that to
avoid any "Unresolved Symbol" warnings. I usually use "cc" or "cxx" as the
driver to "ld" to do this which will include some libraries implicitly
(-lc, -lcxx, -lexc for instance).

